{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:33.115Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"I don't know what I should do"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"I'm currently attending university, but there are times when I don't know what I should do."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Focus on one thing or be broad and shallow?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h3"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Until last year I was trying to master one thing — I was doing software development. That's how I got into university."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"But recently I've been doing things like hardware, and my topics have become scattered."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pa","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"University life"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pd","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pc","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What should I do from now on?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pf","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pe","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Somehow I feel that whatever I do in the future will be eaten by AI, so to be honest lately I don't have the motivation to master one thing, and I no longer feel like doing research that sticks to a particular field."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"I sometimes don't know what I should do.","emoji":"❓","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","title":"Concerns About My Career","translation":{"automatic":true,"sourceId":"01M3TQXT4QQ443KC99MFBQHNJY"}},"id":"01M3TQXX1VSRNJW902FPCFWKGQ","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"my-career-path","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98","label":"Miscellaneous","locale":"en","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9RBDGJT2EZXDA1B5AWCC","label":"essay","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"essay","translationGroup":"01M40J9RBDGJT2EZXDA1B5AWCC"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXT4QQ443KC99MFBQHNJY"}
